        "type": "stage",
        "slug": "streak-doctor"
      },
      "vo": [
        {
          "id": "intro1",
          "text": "It's an open-source command-line tool, published on npm. One command, no install, no sign-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "feature",
      "kicker": "The wedge",
      "headline": "Six reasons a commit [doesn't count.]",
      "bullets": [
        "Commit email not linked to the account",
        "A fork, or not the default branch",
        "A timezone boundary, or just graph lag"
      ],
      "media": {
        "type": "cards",
        "title": "docs/03-knowledge/github-contribution-rules.md",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "mail",
            "title": "Email not linked",
            "sub": "the committer email must be on your account",
            "tag": "1"
          },
          {
            "icon": "git-branch",
            "title": "Not the default branch",
            "sub": "feature-branch work doesn't count",
            "tag": "2"
          },
          {
            "icon": "copy",
            "title": "Committed in a fork",
            "sub": "counts only once merged upstream",
            "tag": "3"
          },
          {
            "icon": "clock",
            "title": "UTC day boundary",
            "sub": "it landed on the next day",
            "tag": "5"
          },
          {
            "icon": "hourglass",
            "title": "Graph lag",
            "sub": "it counted — the grid hasn't caught up",
            "tag": "6"
          }
        ]
      },
      "vo": [
        {
          "id": "rules1",
          "text": "Streak counters are everywhere. Diagnosis isn't. A commit doesn't count if the email isn't linked, if it's in a fork, or if it isn't on the default branch."
        },
        {
          "id": "rules2",
          "text": "Or it landed on the next UTC day, or the graph just hasn't caught up. Those rules are written down in the project, and the engine that checks them is what's being built next."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "feature",
      "kicker": "Live against GitHub",
      "headline": "Today's count, and [how long you have left.]",
      "bullets": [
        "Reads your gh CLI token automatically",
        "Counts down to the end of GitHub's UTC day",
        "--json output with a versioned schema"
      ],
      "flip": true,
